<title>USA: USX-Marathon Group Q3 net rose.</title>
<headline>USX-Marathon Group Q3 net rose.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.57		    $0.32</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.57		    $0.32</p>
<p> Net			164,000		   93,000</p>
<p> Revs		   4,195,000		3,494,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 287,608		  287,408</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     296,640		  287,423</p>
<p>		     Nine Months</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.75		    $0.96</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.74		    $0.96</p>
<p> Net			504,000		  278,000</p>
<p> Revs		  11,893,000	     10,362,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 287,557		  287,281</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     296,590		  287,292</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1995 Q3 net includes net gains of $20 million after loss of $4 million, or $0.01/shr, on early debt payment.</p>
<p>1995 per share after preferred dividends of $1 million in quarter and $4 million in nine months.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 net includes a $60 million after tax gain on an inventory valuation adjustment.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
